{"id":415,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"They swear fealty to a queen Pokémon and work diligently to gather nectar. Each swarm produces a different flavor of honey."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It ceaselessly gathers nectar from sunrise to sundown, all for the sake of Vespiquen and the swarm."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"The members of the trio spend all their time together. Each one has a slightly different taste in nectar."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Pearl"],"text":"It collects and delivers honey to its colony. At night, they cluster to form a beehive and sleep."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"The trio is together from birth. It constantly gathers honey from flowers to please Vespiquen."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"This Pokémon is a set of three. When they sleep, they gather up and form a giant hive of 100 Combee."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"At night, COMBEE sleep in a group of about a thousand, packed closely together in a lump."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"A Pokémon formed by three others. It busily carries sweet floral honey to VESPIQUEN."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Honey Gather","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may gather Honey after a battle."},{"name":"Hustle","hidden":true,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat but lowers its accuracy."}],"eggGroups":["Bug"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Yellow","shape":"Heads","evolution":{"id":415,"name":"Combee","condition":null,"children":[{"id":416,"name":"Vespiquen","condition":"Lv. 21 (female)","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,16],[1,230],[1,450],[1,522]],"machine":[450,405,283,679,806,214,522,851],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv3-8","name":"Combee","set":"Obsidian Flames","date":"2023-08-11","rarity":"Common","number":"8","artist":"HYOGONOSUKE","img":"sv3/8"},{"id":"sv2-8","name":"Combee","set":"Paldea Ev